  "prompts": [
    "Build a local registration drive journey for the 2026 NFL Draft in Pittsburgh, Apr 23-25.",
    "Create a Draft Experience local journey for Pittsburgh fans within drive distance of the 2026 NFL Draft (Apr 23-25). Multi-channel waterfall audience layered across activity, geo, and fav-team. Sequence: registration-open email + push at T-5w, follow-up emails at T-4w and T-3w, then pre-draft ramp T-2w / T-1w / T-3d / T-1d, daily takeover emails Draft Days 1-3, post-draft recap +2 days. SMS to opted-in registrants prompting OnePass app download.",
    "Need a Pittsburgh-local Draft journey for 2026. Reactivate inactive fans into registering, then nurture registrants with trip-planning + SMS through Draft Days."
  ],
